# Line endings: no conversion, no normalization. The files are stored as they are; our own text files use CRLF.
# Third-party code (glm, assimp, stb_image) keeps the line endings it came with.
* -text

# binary files
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.vwf binary
# UTF-16 resource scripts
*.rc binary
